flowchart TD
    Start([Start])
    OpenPage[User opens login page]
    InputData[User enters phone number and password]
    Submit[User submits login form]

    Validate{Are phone number and password provided?}
    ErrorInput[Display input validation error]

    FindUser[System searches user by phone number]
    UserExists{Does user exist?}
    VerifyPassword[System verifies password using password hash]
    PasswordValid{Is password correct?}

    GenerateToken[System generates JWT access token]
    ReturnToken[System returns authentication response and JWT token]
    Success[User successfully logged in]

    ErrorCredential[Display invalid phone number or password]
    End([End])

    Start --> OpenPage
    OpenPage --> InputData
    InputData --> Submit
    Submit --> Validate

    Validate -- No --> ErrorInput
    ErrorInput --> InputData

    Validate -- Yes --> FindUser
    FindUser --> UserExists

    UserExists -- No --> ErrorCredential
    UserExists -- Yes --> VerifyPassword

    VerifyPassword --> PasswordValid
    PasswordValid -- No --> ErrorCredential
    PasswordValid -- Yes --> GenerateToken

    GenerateToken --> ReturnToken
    ReturnToken --> Success
    Success --> End

    ErrorCredential --> InputData